{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X的大块本身交代了人物处境、心理和转折，Y不少高亮词组单独看比较悬空，如“舍不得什么”“猛然想到”，因果关系不够完整；small：Y的句内小字能补出高亮内容的前后关系，例如S08从想起自己人到心里暖了一会儿，再过渡到没有因此回头，衔接更好；core：Y略胜，对归属的具体怀念（不必时时防备、有人在身边、自然亲近）和维护尊严的底线交代得更充分，结尾也更明确。concise：X更省，Y尤其S06、S13对亲近、想念和好好生活的意思有较多重复解释；human：Y更自然，X的“连开心事都不敢想太难受”“离开那些人的难受”“怕再没有”等表达存在搭配或省略压缩不顺的问题；fine：X更胜，较多落在观众具体的身体和心理体验上，如“后颈一凉，脉搏骤快”“胸口像终于吸进一口气，却只一瞬”，Y则有较多和弦、八度、颤音等音乐本身的描写；load：X更胜，大块数量较少，意群也比较完整，Y在S08、S11、S12等较短屏幕里连续安排四个高亮片段，视线切换更频繁，S11末尾的高亮内容也偏长。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ea31a6bc-bf22-4804-961e-7f585b6cbb84", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T185453109882Z", "elapsed_seconds": 275.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T18:59:28.772465+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bc4b88f0031ab4293bb082abadefaf13add46f10ea5da901de641a1e2ea97fb9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256":